{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55816","headline":"古曲偈（《祖堂集》卷十一作《雄颂》） · 如体","name":"古曲偈（《祖堂集》卷十一作《雄颂》）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古曲发声雄，今古唱还同（《五灯会元》作「今时韵亦同」）。\n若论第一拍（《五灯会元》作「指」），祖佛尽迷踪。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十、卷十一、《五灯会元》卷七。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"如体","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}